## 7. MLOps Maturity Model (Microsoft Framework, adopted internally)

Atlassian targets **Level 3 – Automated Model Deployment** as the initial standard:

| Aspect | Level 3 Requirements |
|--------|---------------------|
| **People** | DS working with DE to convert experiments to repeatable scripts; SE automating model integration |
| **Model Creation** | Data pipeline gathers data automatically; Compute managed; Experiment results tracked; Training code + models version controlled |
| **Model Release** | Automatic release; Scoring script version controlled with tests; CI/CD pipeline managed |
| **Application Integration** | Unit/integration tests for each release; Less reliant on DS expertise; Secure/reliable/scalable inference |

**Level 4 – Full MLOps** targets:
- Full traceability from deployment back to original data
- Integrated A/B testing of model performance for deployment
- Automated tests for all code
- Centralized tracking of model training performance
- Full system automated and easily monitored
- Approaching zero-downtime system

[MLOps Framework](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/VAPPDEV/pages/2166657676/Machine+Learning+Operations+MLOps+Framework)

---

## 8. Guidelines for MLE Success

Per internal documentation ("Level Up your ML Craft"):

1. **Solve Problems from First Principles** — don't jump to fancy models; clarify objectives, constraints, success criteria
2. **Go Deep, Not Just Fast** — dive deep into at least one critical aspect per problem
3. **Stay Flexible, Not Fixated** — let results drive decisions, not personal bias
4. **Elevate ML Problem-Solving Rigor** — treat ML like a scientific process; be rigorous in experimentation, validation, documentation, and reproducibility
5. **Prioritize the Right Metrics** — identify which metric truly defines success before modeling; track evolution across experiments; tie to real-world impact
6. **Anchor Metrics in Context** — understand business context, not just optimizing numbers

[Level Up your ML Craft](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~712020b9c471b742f3414899397c898d2dd049/pages/5585955478/Level+Up+your+ML+Craft)

