| **TEAMServe / Triton** | Atlassian's in-house GPU inference platform for latency-sensitive and cost-sensitive models |
| **MSP (Model Serving Platform)** | Registering, versioning, and deploying ML models; integrates with Micros, ML Studio, ML Registry |
| **Micros** | Service deployment platform (`.sd.yml` descriptors) for model endpoints |

