## 4. KPIs and Success Metrics

### Model Performance Metrics

| Category | Metrics |
|----------|---------|
| **Classification** | AUC, Precision, Recall, F1, Accuracy |
| **Ranking/Search** | MRR, NDCG, CLIP (for interleaving experiments), Churn@1 |
| **Clustering** | Coherence (0.92–0.98range), Compactness |
| **Latency** | p50, p90, p95, p99 inference latency (target: sub-100ms p99for online feature serving) |
| **LLM Evaluation** | Token usage, output accuracy, relevance, instruction adherence, conciseness |
| **Operational** | 5xx error rate, 429 rate-limiting incidents, timeout rate |

[The ML Ops Playbook](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ITSOL/pages/4497402253/The+ML+Ops+Playbook+Scaling+Machine+Learning+for+Success)
[One Pager - Model Evaluation Insights Tool](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/rdm/pages/6713380486/One+Pager+-+Model+Evaluation+Insights+Tool)

### Operational Metrics

| Metric | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| **Deployment frequency** | How often models are promoted to production |
| **Rollback rate** | % of deployments requiring rollback |
| **Experiment velocity** | Number of experiments run per sprint/quarter |
| **Time-to-production** | From merged PR to live in production (model onboarding currently ~1week elapsed) |
| **Pipeline failure rate** | Training/inference pipeline failures per period |
| **Autoscaling response time** | Time for infrastructure to scale to load (target: <5 min for sustained load) |
| **Feature freshness** | Time lag between data event and feature availability |

### Business Impact Metrics
- **Revenue lift**: From improved model performance (e.g., better search relevance → engagement)
- **Cost savings**: Tecton→MLFS migration saving $3.24M/year credits + $2.08M DynamoDB replication
- **User engagement**: Adoption, retention metrics influenced by productionized models
- **Experiment impact**: Statistical significance of A/B tests on business KPIs

### Continuous Validation of ML Model Business Value
Per Gartner's MLOps framework:
- Define business KPIs at early stage and measure consistently
- Track model degradation signals by monitoring business indicators
- Continuously measure overall business impact of integrated model collections
[Gartner: Operationalize Machine Learning](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/AnalystRelations/pages/3317171131/2022.11.08+Gartner+Operationalize+Machine+Learning+by+Using+Gartner+s+MLOps+Framework)

