| **ML Fundamentals** | Supervised & unsupervised learning, deep learning, NLP, classical ML models | Strong theoretical + practical |
| **Libraries & Tools** | PyTorch, TensorFlow, scikit-learn, Keras, NumPy, Pandas | Expert-level in at least one DL framework |
| **Production ML** | Data pipelines, model training, evaluation, deployment, productionization at scale | End-to-end ownership |
| **Data Engineering** | Spark/PySpark, cloud data environments (AWS, Databricks), streaming | Proficient for large-scale data |

