From [ML Platform MLSE Template](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~638712ff5fc160544e1bf8c6/pages/5886406439/P40+-+ML+Platform+MLSE+Job+Description+Template):

- **Comprehensive ML lifecycle expertise**: End-to-end ML systems from data engineering to model serving and monitoring
- **Large-scale system design**: Scalable, fault-tolerant, high-performance distributed systems for ML
- **Framework proficiency**: Expert-level in PyTorch, TensorFlow, or JAX
- **MLOps and automation**: CI/CD pipelines, continuous training, deployment, and monitoring
- **Cloud infrastructure**: AWS, GCP, specific AI/ML services and GPU compute resources
