### 3.4 Level Calibration (Atlassian-specific)

From internal hiring data:
- **P40 (MLE)**: 3–8 years typical; design model architectures, conduct experimentation and evaluations
- **P50 (Senior MLE)**: 6–9 years typical; drive development, provide guidance to junior engineers, lead projects
- **P60 (Principal MLE)**: 10+ years; steer development of advanced ML algorithms, architecture standards, mentor, company-wide impact

